## Week 2: SIEM Deployment (CIS Control 8)

### Objective
Deploy centralized logging and real-time detection capability to prove audit logging and monitoring.

### Completed Actions

**Part 1: Lab Network Isolation**
- [x] Created isolated lab bridge (vmbr1) on Proxmox
- [x] Configured for future attack/defense exercises
